app.degraded	app entered degraded (observe window failure / post-window instability / W_DEPLOY_INSTABILITY)
app.deleted	app deletion completed (tombstone second beat: managed services removed, name enters retention hold)
app.instability_detected	instability detected at runtime
app.recovered	app left degraded, back to running
app.webhook_fetch_failed	async source fetch failed after webhook acceptance (retry manually via redeliver on the same delivery)
build.stale_nonterminal	build stayed queued/building past 2x the build timeout budget (surfaces state-machine bugs; no self-healing)
cron.skipped	cron trigger skipped (node not ready / control plane down at the tick / overlapping skip); no catch-up run
deployment.cancelled	deploy cancelled (replays the prior state first, then lands cancelled)
deployment.failed	deploy failed (terminal state; reason=error code)
deployment.healthy	new revision passed the health gate
deployment.observe_started	observe window started (default 60s)
deployment.queued	deploy queued (per-app mutually exclusive queueing)
deployment.recovery_blocked	recovery blocked (e.g. bound node unavailable)
deployment.recovery_scheduled	recovery from systemic failure queued (automatic retry action)
deployment.release_started	release started (build/update kicking off)
deployment.rollback_failed	rollback failed
deployment.rollback_finished	rollback finished
deployment.rollback_started	rollback started (single-layer replay of the revision)
deployment.substrate_halted	substrate failure halted the deploy (Swarm/node unavailable)
deployment.succeeded	deploy succeeded (terminal state)
deployment.superseded	deploy superseded by a newer target (stale terminal state)
deployment.switched	traffic switch completed
deployment.warning	deploy warning (W_ code; observe window alert-only semantics)
engine.stale_nonterminal	deploy stayed non-terminal past 2x the (deploy watchdog + observe window) budget (surfaces state-machine bugs; no self-healing)
node.down	node judged DOWN (Swarm loss-of-contact verdict)
node.joined	node joined the cluster (observed)
node.removed	node removed (observed docker node rm)
node.up	node back to ready
placement.blocked	bound node unavailable/removed; app blocked
placement.bound	app node binding completed (including automatic pinning)
placement.changed	binding changed (via the explicitly confirmed migration path)
placement.recovered	bound node recovered; binding re-established automatically
placement.unresolved	binding undecidable after DR; explicit placement required (no guessing)
reconcile.drift_detected	drift detected between desired and actual state (including manual docker operations); convergence is per-app opt-in
restore.completed	control plane restore completed (after exiting read-only observation)
route.publish_failed	app ingress route publish failed (deploy unaffected; alerts separately)
route.published	app ingress routes published (after the health gate passed, all dynamic config converged)
volume.created	volume registered (data birthplace; pins the hosting node)
volume.detached	volume detached (volume declaration removed; data is not deleted with the declaration)
volume.discarded	volume explicitly discarded (admin+confirm+audited)
volume.orphaned	volume orphaned (old volume kept by default after app deletion / after --discard)
